# Maintainer: Jean Iaquinta <jeani@uio.no>
pkgname=lamem
pkgver=3.1.0
pkgrel=0
pkgdesc="Lithosphere and Mantle Evolution Model - a geodynamic finite difference code"
url="https://github.com/UniMainzGeo/LaMEM"
license="MIT"
arch="x86_64 aarch64"
makedepends="
	mpich-dev
	petsc-dev
	"
source="
	$pkgname-$pkgver.tar.gz::https://github.com/UniMainzGeo/LaMEM/archive/refs/tags/v$pkgver.tar.gz
	cxx-detection.patch
	falling_block.dat
	"
builddir="$srcdir/LaMEM-$pkgver"

build() {
	export PETSC_OPT=/usr

	cd "$builddir"/src
	make mode=opt all -j"$(nproc)"
}

check() {
	mkdir -p "$builddir"/_check
	cp "$srcdir"/falling_block.dat "$builddir"/_check/
	cd "$builddir"/_check

	export FI_PROVIDER=tcp
	mpiexec -n 2 "$builddir"/bin/opt/LaMEM \
		-ParamFile falling_block.dat -nstep_max 1
	test -f FB_multigrid.pvd
}

package() {
	install -Dm755 "$builddir"/bin/opt/LaMEM \
		"$pkgdir"/usr/bin/$pkgname

	install -Dm644 "$builddir"/LICENSE \
		"$pkgdir"/usr/share/licenses/$pkgname/LICENSE
}

sha512sums="
17bacd8c10e2aad5757644f1e64bb5de3e4eef6ca10a4dbd4b68a8be6f4c23d3559ea93e8e03b72d2adb7572d4ff40fcb0ff628f0217408483f642800464c355  lamem-3.1.0.tar.gz
	7a269d3949a2f4412104cb655d935494353bf97fbb89f9bbcd0112ec2893ce024580b653528b7673e5700dfcbc8454b3676aa08a9e62854759a4b7521329ea8d  cxx-detection.patch
2a3f3476bfb1d248c5b1350fd213a10c4ab8f43269a1f412eef68dc6ca3af9fd1a8f2343a4123be24d77821343085aad6a7dee6f2ab9d295148f95cdfb937140  falling_block.dat
"